---
/**
 * Coaching page: “Who We Help” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-9a0d8d5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="9a0d8d5"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  id="whowehelp"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-b7900f3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="b7900f3"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-a281a51 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
        data-id="a281a51"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="heading.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container"><h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Who We Help</h2></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-fc123fd e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child"
      data-id="fc123fd"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-40ceb23 vb-view-default vb-position-block-start vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="40ceb23"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-address-card"></i> </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> CXOs </span></h3>
              <p class="vb-icon-box-description">
                Empowering CXOs Through Executive Coaching to Lead with Vision, Clarity, and Impact in a VUCA world
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-254af93 vb-view-default vb-position-block-start vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="254af93"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"
                  ><path
                    d="M12 19H14V6.00003L20.3939 8.74028C20.7616 8.89786 21 9.2594 21 9.65943V19H23V21H1V19H3V5.6499C3 5.25472 3.23273 4.89659 3.59386 4.73609L11.2969 1.31251C11.5493 1.20035 11.8448 1.314 11.9569 1.56634C11.9853 1.63027 12 1.69945 12 1.76941V19Z"
                  ></path></svg
                >
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> Professionals </span></h3>
              <p class="vb-icon-box-description">
                Leadership, Performance, Career &amp;Transition Coaching to build resilience, seek direction and growth,
                enhance influence, and manage stakeholders.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-19027af vb-view-default vb-position-block-start vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="19027af"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"
                  ><path
                    d="M7 9C8.38071 9 9.5 7.88071 9.5 6.5C9.5 5.11929 8.38071 4 7 4C5.61929 4 4.5 5.11929 4.5 6.5C4.5 7.88071 5.61929 9 7 9ZM7 11C4.51472 11 2.5 8.98528 2.5 6.5C2.5 4.01472 4.51472 2 7 2C9.48528 2 11.5 4.01472 11.5 6.5C11.5 8.98528 9.48528 11 7 11ZM17.5 13C18.6046 13 19.5 12.1046 19.5 11C19.5 9.89543 18.6046 9 17.5 9C16.3954 9 15.5 9.89543 15.5 11C15.5 12.1046 16.3954 13 17.5 13ZM17.5 15C15.2909 15 13.5 13.2091 13.5 11C13.5 8.79086 15.2909 7 17.5 7C19.7091 7 21.5 8.79086 21.5 11C21.5 13.2091 19.7091 15 17.5 15ZM20 21V20.5C20 19.1193 18.8807 18 17.5 18C16.1193 18 15 19.1193 15 20.5V21H13V20.5C13 18.0147 15.0147 16 17.5 16C19.9853 16 22 18.0147 22 20.5V21H20ZM10 21V17C10 15.3431 8.65685 14 7 14C5.34315 14 4 15.3431 4 17V21H2V17C2 14.2386 4.23858 12 7 12C9.76142 12 12 14.2386 12 17V21H10Z"
                  ></path></svg
                >
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> Founders – Start-ups and SMBs </span></h3>
              <p class="vb-icon-box-description">
                Business Coaching to build, scale, and lead impactfully, while managing change for sustainable growth.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-e079f8a vb-view-default vb-position-block-start vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="e079f8a"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"
                  ><path
                    d="M12 10C14.2091 10 16 8.20914 16 6 16 3.79086 14.2091 2 12 2 9.79086 2 8 3.79086 8 6 8 8.20914 9.79086 10 12 10ZM5.5 13C6.88071 13 8 11.8807 8 10.5 8 9.11929 6.88071 8 5.5 8 4.11929 8 3 9.11929 3 10.5 3 11.8807 4.11929 13 5.5 13ZM21 10.5C21 11.8807 19.8807 13 18.5 13 17.1193 13 16 11.8807 16 10.5 16 9.11929 17.1193 8 18.5 8 19.8807 8 21 9.11929 21 10.5ZM12 11C14.7614 11 17 13.2386 17 16V22H7V16C7 13.2386 9.23858 11 12 11ZM5 15.9999C5 15.307 5.10067 14.6376 5.28818 14.0056L5.11864 14.0204C3.36503 14.2104 2 15.6958 2 17.4999V21.9999H5V15.9999ZM22 21.9999V17.4999C22 15.6378 20.5459 14.1153 18.7118 14.0056 18.8993 14.6376 19 15.307 19 15.9999V21.9999H22Z"
                  ></path></svg
                >
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> Corporate Teams and Organisations </span></h3>
              <p class="vb-icon-box-description">
                Team Coaching and Development Programs to build capabilities of Engagement, Innovation, and Execution
                Excellence
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
